              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya Ilmi Nama guddinna ufitiini d'ufu malaika ch'ufa woliini, inni barch'uma guddinna ufi gubba tae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nami lafa tana ch'ufti isa durati wolwoldaa. Jennaani inni fulla lamati gargari worra foha, akuma tissituuni ree ufi, hooliyefi laleesa gargari footu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hooliye harka mirga deebise, laleesa harka bitaacha deebisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Hayyuuni waan hooliye harka mirgatiini jed'u, Abbaani kiyya ya isani eebise, koota, guddinna haga lafa uumani isani mid'aasani seena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa anini beela qabu beela naa baaftani, ana d'eebu qabu, d'eebu naa baaftani, ana keessuma na bulchitani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ana daara qabu daara na baaftani, anini fayya d'amnaani na qorqorattani, na hid'ani jennaani d'uftani na ilaaltani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri d'uga duuba waan jed'u, Aabbo, yoomi sii beela qabdu arginaani beela si baamne, sii d'eebote d'eebu si baamne? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoomi sii keessuma arginaani si bulchine, sii daara qabdu arginaani daara si baamne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sii fayya d'abde yokhaani hid'aansa keesa jirtu si ilaale? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni waan jed'u, Waan anini isaniti himu, waan oboleyaani tiyya didiqo tanaa tolchitani yayu nale tolchitani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba waan worra harka bitatiini jed'u, Na biraa bada, isani abaarsa Waaqa qabdani; gara ibida ind'aamne bada, ka Sheet'anafi malaika isaati bobeesani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa anini beela qabu beela na baasu diddani, ka anini d'eebod'e d'eebu na baasu diddani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaafa anini keessuma na bulchu diddani, ka anini daara qabu daara na baasu diddani; gaafa anini fayyad'abe hid'aansa keesa jiru na ilaalu diddani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri waan jed'uuni, Aabbo, nu yoomi taka sii beela qabdu yokhaani sii d'eebu qabdu yokhaani sii keessuma yokhaani sii daara qabdu yokhaani sii fayyad'abde yokhaani sii hid'aansa keesa jirtu argine si qarqaaru dinne? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'uuni, D'uguma, waan anini isaniini jed'u, yo isani worra didiqa kana qarqaaru diddani, yayu nale qarqaaru diddani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra kana gara gaargala ind'umanne ergani, worra d'uga gara jireenna ind'umanne ergani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
